{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submerse yourself and explore the underwater world as a fish! Play as one of many saltwater fish species, as you navigate through shallow grass flats or pelagic depths. You'll need to hunt and eat other smaller fish to grow and unlock new species. But watch out danger lurks in the distance and around every structure! Start the game as a Mangrove Snapper, explore the world with its many wrecks and underwater structures. Keep your distance from larger predators or end up as dinner. While avoiding danger eat smaller fish to earn bones and use them to unlock the next species.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002420?t=1758670248","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002420?t=1758670248","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002420/1e8f1883028df23ee0f8dbfb8f88ca3379974a96/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758670248","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002420/1e8f1883028df23ee0f8dbfb8f88ca3379974a96/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758670248","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submerse yourself and explore the underwater world as a fish! Play as one of many saltwater fish species, as you navigate through shallow grass flats or pelagic depths. You'll need to hunt and eat other smaller fish to grow and unlock new species. But watch out danger lurks in the distance and around every structure! Start the game as a Mangrove Snapper, explore the world with its many wrecks and underwater structures. Keep your distance from larger predators or end up as dinner. While avoiding danger eat smaller fish to earn bones and use them to unlock the next species.</p>","developers":["Slack Tide Games"],"genres":[{"de